# @see R-030 (Design Patterns vs Native Platform Features)
id: PATTERN-006
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: External service call without circuit breaker or timeout
category: quality
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .tsx .jsx .java .py .go
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: fetch\s*\([^)]*https?://
    message: "External HTTP call — consider adding a circuit breaker and timeout for resilience against downstream failures"
  - regex: axios\.\w+\s*\([^)]*https?://
    message: "Axios call to external service — add timeout and circuit breaker (opossum, cockatiel) to prevent cascading failures"
  - regex: HttpClient\.\w+\s*\(|this\.http\.\w+\s*\(
    message: "HTTP client call — for external services, ensure timeout and retry with backoff are configured"
  - regex: requests\.(get|post|put|delete|patch)\s*\(
    message: "Python requests call — add timeout parameter and consider circuit breaker (pybreaker, tenacity) for external services"
fix: Wrap external service calls with circuit breaker pattern. Libraries — opossum/cockatiel (Node.js), resilience4j (Java), pybreaker (Python), gobreaker (Go). Always set timeouts.
